(3,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-01 08:34:17','2026-09-01 08:34:17'),
(4,5,'Top Coding Mistakes Beginners. How to Avoid Them','Learning to code for the first time can be exciting and confusing at the same time. One day you write a program and feel really proud of yourself. The day one small error keeps you stuck for an hour. This is very normal. Every student goes through this stage. The good thing is that most  coding mistakes beginners make  can be fixed with practice and a calm mindset.','coding, mistake in coding, laravel, ai','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-02 05:41:41','2026-09-02 05:41:41'),
(5,6,'The Power of Action','The path to success is to take massive, determined action','quote, motivation, success, action','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-02 05:44:08','2026-09-02 05:44:08'),
(6,7,'Never Give Up','Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts.','success, failure','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-02 05:45:31','2026-09-02 05:45:31'),
(7,8,'Dream Big','The future belongs to those who believe in the beauty of their dreams.','Dream Big, future , dreams, believe','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-02 05:47:12','2026-09-02 05:47:12'),
(8,9,'Keep Moving Forward','The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing','quit talking, motivation, Moving Forward','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-02 05:48:36','2026-09-02 05:48:36'),
(9,10,'How Smart Companies Use Economic Moats To Thrive In Volatile Times','Companies whose leadership treats every strategic choice as a moat decision will be the ones that create durable shareholder value through 2030 and beyond.','Anil Chintapalli','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 05:42:18','2026-09-03 05:42:18'),
(10,11,'ICC Test rankings: Shubman Gill, Jasprit Bumrah slip; Devdutt Padikkal moves up','ICC Test rankings: Shubman Gill, Jasprit Bumrah slip; Devdutt Padikkal moves up','sports, cricket, india','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 05:49:09','2026-09-03 05:49:09'),
(11,12,'Rohit Sharma Was Angry But Agreed: Report Makes Huge \'Retirement\' Claim','The futures of Rohit Sharma, Virat Kohli and Ravindra Jadeja will be up for discussion at the BCCI meeting on Thursday as India begin their road to the ODI World Cup 2027, according to a report.','Rohit Sharma,Angry ,Retirement,sports,cricket','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 05:52:39','2026-09-03 05:52:39'),
(12,13,'768-strong contingent: 503 athletes, 246 officials – India at 2026 Asian Games','The Sports Ministry approved 11 more athletes to its already released list of 492 for the 2026 Asian Games.','athletes,sports,india','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:10:41','2026-09-03 06:10:41'),
(13,14,'HbA1c and anaemia: Why your blood sugar test may not tell the full story','Anaemia can affect red blood cells, which play an important role in HbA1c testing. Experts explain how different types of anaemia may influence blood sugar test results.','blood sugar, blood cells','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:15:18','2026-09-03 06:15:18'),
(14,15,'Simple Ways to Balance Your Mind, Body, and Soul','If you caught this post, you would be well acquainted with the fact that my goal since starting my blog in 2016 has been to ensure I deliver content according to your needs, dear reader. Fashion and travel aside, I have been consistent in sharing posts on personal wellness and blogging tips here on Urban Diaries, that have helped me and in turn, have hopefully helped you. I continue to seek inspiration from elements around me and am working towards developing these insights into business models','mind,body,lifestyle,soul','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:18:34','2026-09-03 06:18:34'),
(15,16,'Chocolate Crunch Raspberry Waffles','A big part of the holiday celebration might be Christmas dinner, but Christmas morning is when the magic really starts. And, what better way to make Christmas even more magical than to serve a special Christmas day breakfast! Although cinnamon rolls seem to be the popular choice, I’d like you to make a new holiday memory this year with these delicious, light and fluffy Christmas Waffles.','Chocolate, Crunch, Raspberry Waffles','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:29:30','2026-09-03 06:29:30'),
(16,17,'Resolve to Undo Holiday Overindulgence','Never do we feel the need to enjoy as much as during the holiday season when time seems to be slipping away like sand, the year coming to an inevitable end; when we lose our days to holiday shopping and nights to endless partying!','lifestyle','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:37:35','2026-09-03 06:37:35'),
(17,18,'Technology: The Good, The Bad, The Ugly','Technology is a critical component of our world today. From communication and time management to manufacturing and healthcare, tech tools have an enormous impact on our lives. And for students at UA Grantham, it’s also what allows them to find success in school no matter where they are located.','tech,technology,good,bad,ugly','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:42:33','2026-09-03 06:42:33'),
(18,19,'AI Trust Gap With Young Adults Could Carry a High Cost','The technology industry\'s enormous investment in artificial intelligence is colliding with a growing trust problem among younger adults. Recent polling suggests many Americans ages 18 to 34 distrust prominent AI executives and worry about how the technology could affect their careers.','ai, trust, tech, technology,cost','index,follow',NULL,'2026-09-03 06:48:49','2026-09-03 06:48:49');

